# MatureCamRooms — Cursor rules (SEO, performance, monetization)

## Stack
- Next.js 15 (14+ App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS.
- Prefer Server Components; use Client Components only for interactivity (filters, bookmarks).
- Use the `@/*` import alias for all internal modules.

## SEO
- Every public route must export `metadata` or `generateMetadata` with unique `title`, `description`, and canonical URL via `alternates.canonical`.
- Use `metadataBase` from `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` in the root layout.
- Add Open Graph and Twitter card fields (`openGraph`, `twitter`) on index and category pages.
- Emit JSON-LD (`WebPage`, `ItemList`, `VideoObject` on room pages) via dedicated components under `src/components/seo/`.
- Default niche keywords: milf, mature, cougar, mom (see `NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_TAGS`).
- Legal/compliance pages (2257, DMCA, Privacy, Terms) must be `index: false` unless explicitly approved.
- Use semantic HTML: one `h1` per page, descriptive `alt` on thumbnails, `aria-label` on icon-only controls.

## Performance
- Target Edge runtime (`export const runtime = "edge"`) for read-heavy listing pages when compatible.
- Lazy-load thumbnails (`loading="lazy"`, `next/image` with sensible `sizes`).
- Defer iframes and embeds: render placeholder first; load iframe on hover, click, or `IntersectionObserver`.
- Avoid blocking third-party scripts in the critical path; use `next/script` with `afterInteractive` or `lazyOnload`.
- Keep LCP image/thumbnail prioritized only for above-the-fold slots.

## Monetization & affiliate links
- All outbound affiliate, smartlink, and cam-room URLs must use `rel="nofollow sponsored"` (and `noopener noreferrer` when `target="_blank"`).
- Centralize URL building in `src/lib/affiliate/` — never hardcode affiliate IDs in components.
- Label sponsored tiles/CTAs clearly (e.g. “Sponsored”, “Live on …”) for UX and compliance.
- Do not cloak or misrepresent destination sites.

## Content filters (mature niche)
- Default catalog filters: tags `milf`, `mature`, `cougar`, `mom` from `NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_TAGS`.
- Room/model APIs and mock data should bias toward 30+ / mature performers unless a route explicitly widens the filter.
- Exclude underage or ambiguous age copy; use “18+” and “adults only” in footers and meta where appropriate.

## Code style
- Minimize scope; match existing naming and folder layout.
- No secrets in the repo; use `.env.local` and Cloudflare Pages environment variables for production.
